WEBVTT

00:06:29.813 --> 00:06:32.976
You can get the latest sports scores, etc.

00:06:33.884 --> 00:06:35.976
This is a more controversial one.

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:37.651
(Laughter)

00:06:37.675 --> 00:06:39.976
As you interact with someone at TED,

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:43.976
maybe you can see
a word cloud of the tags,

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:46.728
the words that are associated
with that person

00:06:46.752 --> 00:06:49.500
in their blog and personal web pages.

00:06:49.524 --> 00:06:54.677
In this case, the student
is interested in cameras, etc.

00:06:54.701 --> 00:06:56.657
On your way to the airport,

00:06:56.681 --> 00:07:00.750
if you pick up your boarding pass, it can
tell you that your flight is delayed,